    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undershadows</strong> is a darkly absurd adventure with a fully hand-drawn world, a unique real-time point-and-click combat system, and a shadow companion with more personality than you might expect.<br><strong>Some places you never forget. Others never let you leave.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f <strong>A dark adventure with bite</strong><br>Uncover an absurd, melancholic story about loss, identity, and twisted fates \u2013 filled with dark humor, moral gray areas, and nasty surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/a2b304f59b2d48bc08d2826055a0bad0.poster.avif?t=1744853846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/a2b304f59b2d48bc08d2826055a0bad0.webm?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/a2b304f59b2d48bc08d2826055a0bad0.mp4?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>800+ hand-drawn scenes</strong><br>Explore a surreal world brought to life by hand \u2013 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >just real illustrations shaped by shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Tactical real-time combat with point-and-click action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on enemies to attack in real time, deflect projectiles with precise timing, unleash powerful skills, and use items from your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: each enemy type has unique behavior \u2013 some transform mid-battle, strike back when defeated, or can kill you in a single blow. Others challenge you with puzzles or projectile patterns. No fight is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/cbf4ed14cf0cee058402dc6d62a2cdfb.poster.avif?t=1744853846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/cbf4ed14cf0cee058402dc6d62a2cdfb.webm?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/cbf4ed14cf0cee058402dc6d62a2cdfb.mp4?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Nightmarish boss fights with unique flow</strong><br>Face massive shadow creatures that reshape entire levels \u2013 complete with special rules, unexpected attacks, and story events mid-battle.<br>No boss is the same. None will go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/f113bfe52d8d318c15922f62d6c41374.poster.avif?t=1744853846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/f113bfe52d8d318c15922f62d6c41374.webm?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/f113bfe52d8d318c15922f62d6c41374.mp4?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Train your evolving shadow</strong><br>Your companion is more than a monster \u2013 it\u2019s you. Level it up, choose transformation paths (e.g. Nature &gt; Beast &gt; Hydra or Tech &gt; Weapons &gt; Rocket Launcher), unlock new abilities, and define your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/7ab0013609a2e44456398b369dac5c4e.poster.avif?t=1744853846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/7ab0013609a2e44456398b369dac5c4e.webm?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/7ab0013609a2e44456398b369dac5c4e.mp4?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>The shadows talk \u2013 way too much</strong><br>You're joined by a sarcastic, borderline psychotic mask that never shuts up, comments on everything \u2013 and might just drive you insane. Maybe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf12 <strong>The Shadowlands await</strong><br>Journey through a semi-open world. Forests that breathe. Caves that scream. An ancient castle hidden in the mountains.<br>A cheerful town\u2026<br>A <i>what</i>?<br>Ugh. I hate those red noses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Deep sidequests &amp; surreal puzzles</strong><br>Nothing is what it seems. Not even the shadows trying to help you.<br>But is being alone really the better option?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undershadows</strong> is a darkly absurd adventure with a fully hand-drawn world, a unique real-time point-and-click combat system, and a shadow companion with more personality than you might expect.<br><strong>Some places you never forget. Others never let you leave.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f <strong>A dark adventure with bite</strong><br>Uncover an absurd, melancholic story about loss, identity, and twisted fates \u2013 filled with dark humor, moral gray areas, and nasty surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/a2b304f59b2d48bc08d2826055a0bad0.poster.avif?t=1744853846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/a2b304f59b2d48bc08d2826055a0bad0.webm?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/a2b304f59b2d48bc08d2826055a0bad0.mp4?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>800+ hand-drawn scenes</strong><br>Explore a surreal world brought to life by hand \u2013 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >just real illustrations shaped by shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Tactical real-time combat with point-and-click action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on enemies to attack in real time, deflect projectiles with precise timing, unleash powerful skills, and use items from your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: each enemy type has unique behavior \u2013 some transform mid-battle, strike back when defeated, or can kill you in a single blow. Others challenge you with puzzles or projectile patterns. No fight is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/cbf4ed14cf0cee058402dc6d62a2cdfb.poster.avif?t=1744853846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/cbf4ed14cf0cee058402dc6d62a2cdfb.webm?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/cbf4ed14cf0cee058402dc6d62a2cdfb.mp4?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Nightmarish boss fights with unique flow</strong><br>Face massive shadow creatures that reshape entire levels \u2013 complete with special rules, unexpected attacks, and story events mid-battle.<br>No boss is the same. None will go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/f113bfe52d8d318c15922f62d6c41374.poster.avif?t=1744853846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/f113bfe52d8d318c15922f62d6c41374.webm?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/f113bfe52d8d318c15922f62d6c41374.mp4?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Train your evolving shadow</strong><br>Your companion is more than a monster \u2013 it\u2019s you. Level it up, choose transformation paths (e.g. Nature &gt; Beast &gt; Hydra or Tech &gt; Weapons &gt; Rocket Launcher), unlock new abilities, and define your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/7ab0013609a2e44456398b369dac5c4e.poster.avif?t=1744853846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/7ab0013609a2e44456398b369dac5c4e.webm?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457210/extras/7ab0013609a2e44456398b369dac5c4e.mp4?t=1744853846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>The shadows talk \u2013 way too much</strong><br>You're joined by a sarcastic, borderline psychotic mask that never shuts up, comments on everything \u2013 and might just drive you insane. Maybe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf12 <strong>The Shadowlands await</strong><br>Journey through a semi-open world. Forests that breathe. Caves that scream. An ancient castle hidden in the mountains.<br>A cheerful town\u2026<br>A <i>what</i>?<br>Ugh. I hate those red noses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Deep sidequests &amp; surreal puzzles</strong><br>Nothing is what it seems. Not even the shadows trying to help you.<br>But is being alone really the better option?</p>",
